WEBVTT

00:10.000 --> 00:13.500
We taught the machines how.

00:21.500 --> 00:25.500
Now they do it better than we ever did.

00:32.000 --> 00:35.000
They can build anything.

00:37.000 --> 00:41.500
They just don't know what is worth building.

01:01.000 --> 01:05.000
That part was never theirs to take.

01:24.000 --> 01:26.400
If you have your why...

01:26.400 --> 01:31.000
you can bear almost any how.
